              "type": "text",
              "text": "Annie buys a car. After 6 years of declining-balance depreciation at 20% p.a., the value of the car is $18874.37. How much did she pay for the car, to the nearest dollar?",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\$72\\,000$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}S&=V_0(1-r)^n\\\\18874.37&=V_0(1-0.2)^6\\\\V_0&=\\frac{18874.37}{0.8^6}\\end{align*}$$\nAnnie paid $\\$72\\,000$, to the nearest dollar.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
